## Watch the Presentation

[▶ Watch the RTL Workshop Presentation](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jmAAQ5QX7SbNJgybP0YwjA5xS_p52I7d/view?usp=sharing)

This video demonstrates my RTL Design and Synthesis Workshop, including:

- RTL design and Verilog simulation
- Testbench code and waveform analysis
- Sequential logic and synthesis
- Combinational and sequential optimization
- Gate-level simulation
- Physical design materials
- Static timing analysis and reports
